    "body": "The names of dictionaries are arbitrary, since they are not exposed to web developers. For COOP/COEP in particular they're not needed; I guess for some other types they might be needed. But the only important thing, guaranteed by the spec, is that report bodies have certain fields. The spec doesn't need to make up names. If MDN wants to, it can.",
